    {
      "id": "claim_04ff30dd52f44b62aa6752a85eefce9b",
      "statement": "The node lease nodes/<node>.json carries the advertise address, expiry, peer protocol, per-process generation, advisory load, paced-handoff support, and the folded node-log state; an unsealed folded log state gates takeover of that node's cells behind node-log recovery, and the core (not the adapter) decides whether the record is live and routable.",
