    {
      "id": "claim_0936d95173a94923ba78015af342def1",
      "statement": "Every activation advances the epoch and replicated data is written under the epoch-prefixed path, so one epoch never has two writers and stale owners land in superseded prefixes; a lost CAS response enters ReconcilingAcquire, which re-reads and continues the same acquisition with its attempt count preserved rather than racing a new claim.",
      "evidence": [
