      "statement": "A node renews its lease after one third of the TTL, retries renewals while the published expiry has not passed, and self-fences terminally when the expiry passes or the lease is replaced: active cells stop, incomplete requests fail, and the process exits with the SELF-FENCE line and code 3.",
